	subj := commonReferenceTypeResource(name)
	// Punned: an object property (the predicate of the edge) and a class (the type
	// of the edge's reifier) on one IRI, generalising to ardoq:Reference in both
	// roles. The two links are emitted and deleted together — with only one of
	// them, either the edges or the reifiers drop out of their chain.
	return []Op{
